      "message": "Out of curiosity, why are these in ConnectivityManager instead of NetworkPolicyManager? ISTM that the NPM code is what decides which flag(s) have meaning and which do not, and in any case, ConnectivityManager and ConnectivityService don\u0027t do much with these ints except pass them straight back to NetworkPolicyManager / NetworkPolicyManagerInternal.",
