      "writtenOn": "2021-02-12T12:05:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Mainly because the API entry point (which takes these flags) that clients use is in ConnectivityManager and also ConnectivityService does care about at least one flag: https://r.android.com/c/platform/frameworks/base/+/1586726/2/services/core/java/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java#1428 (Although I\u0027m not actually sure if this conditional currently is at the right place or if it is supposed to ignore only networkpolicy restrictions).",
